Package: ancombc2rs
Type: Package
Title: ANCOM-BC2 Differential Abundance, Backed by Rust
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("ancombc2-rs", "contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "noreply@example.invalid")
Description: A wrapper for 'ancombc2-rs', a Rust reimplementation of ANCOM-BC2.
    The analysis itself runs in Rust; this package builds the design matrix with
    R's own 'model.matrix', calls the core through a C ABI, and returns the
    reference's result tables. The compatibility target is ANCOMBC 2.15.2 at
    commit dc4febdf59badb3a8dfe0c767ef2186323c2199a, under R 4.5.x with seed 42.
License: Artistic-2.0
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: jsonlite, stats, utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    microbiome,
    mia,
    phyloseq,
    SummarizedExperiment
SystemRequirements: Rust (>= 1.75) and a C compiler, for building the bundled
    core; see src/Makevars and README.md
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
